n":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"首次注册与自动重连还存在认证设计缺陷：当前 Host WSS token 是 Relay 内存中的一次性 15 分钟 token；连接成功即消费，任何断线或 Relay 重启后都无法自行重新认证。把 token 改为可重复 bearer 或长期 secret 都会削弱既定安全边界。\n\n正确方案是：\n\n- Owner 签发的一次性 Host access token 仅用于首次注册；\n- 首次注册同时提交显式 `ed25519-x509` Host auth 公钥和独立 `x25519-raw` Noise 公钥；\n- 后续重连由 Relay 发 nonce，Host 用既有 Ed25519 identity 签名，Relay 验证后签发新的单次 WSS token；\n- Relay 只持久化两把公钥和 presence metadata，不获得任何私钥/HCP 明文。\n\n这也让 Relay restart 后 Host 能恢复 presence。现在先扩展 Relay wire/metadata/auth contract，再接 connector。"},{"id":"tool-call-call_ORGiSRbBtV8pTfTM9w8PGLVU","kind":"toolCall","title":"grep | head -220 \"CREATE TABLE.*hosts|ji_relay_hosts|saveHost|Host\\(\" E:\\Projects\\Code\\AI\\Ji\\ji-java\\applications\\ji-relay-server\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\relay\\SqliteRelayMetadataStore.java","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_ORGiSRbBtV8pTfTM9w8PGLVU","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","seq":8916,"startedSeq":8900,"endedSeq":8916,"timestamp":"1788624780Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Grep","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_ZLY0znh1GHiXGYoavzm6tCg6","kind":"toolCall","title":"Read ji-java\\applications\\ji-relay-server\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\relay\\RelayMetadataStore.java (1 - 300)","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_ZLY0znh1GHiXGYoavzm6tCg6","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","seq":8908,"startedSeq":8902,"endedSeq":8908,"timestamp":"1788624780Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Read","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_jXIm84W8RO5NHs4lxXv7wDVS","kind":"toolCall","title":"Read ji-java\\applications\\ji-relay-server\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\relay\\MemoryRelayMetadataStore.java (1 - 220)","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_jXIm84W8RO5NHs4lxXv7wDVS","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","seq":8